# A NOR game whose launch fails (/SAVER is a file, so its save can't be
# made): WRITE TO NOR CLEAN puts Hello.gba on the game NOR, and its launch
# (both through the menu's test hook) shows the error; after it home comes
# back whole, drawn without a key (the list stayed black until one before
# v0.3.2)
#! sd-rm /SAVER
#! sd-file /SAVER 16 tests/roms/hello/hello.gba
#! expect-error error 2:
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Hello.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:0x7E000003
-w "nor: list saved"
-w "nav: home ready"
-p @8:nav_test_action:0x7E000006
-w "screen ready: dialog"
-s @1:error.png
-k @8:B -k @12:-
-s @40:back.png
-s @200:later.png
